### Usage & Contribution Note

This repository is a personal engineering portfolio and learning record.

- You are free to fork, adopt, or adapt this curriculum framework and templates for your own personal studies under the terms above.
- Direct code/curriculum contributions (pull requests) to this specific repository are not accepted, as it documents an individual learning progression.
- Suggestions, feedback, and architectural discussions are welcome via GitHub Issues.
